&lt;p&gt;ZipRecruiter is a leading online employment marketplace. Powered by AI-driven smart matching technology, the company actively connects millions of all-sized businesses and job seekers through innovative mobile, web, and email services, as well as through partnerships with the best job boards on the web. ZipRecruiter has the #1 rated job search app on iOS &amp;amp; Android.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a Sr. Product Manager on our SMB team, you will own the core experience of our applicant tracking system for employers, with the opportunity to rethink how it is structured and how it works. You&#39;ll drive the strategy and execution behind increasing employer review and response rates on the platform, and you will own the development of our employer mobile app. You&#39;ll partner closely with Engineering, Design, and Decision Science to build scalable product experiences that drive more conversations and help employers hire qualified candidates faster. This is one of the areas of the business where we can test and learn the fastest, so you&#39;ll have room to ship often and move quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Focus Areas:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as an Owner: &lt;/strong&gt;Take full accountability for your product domain, from high-level KPI setting to the nuances of daily execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reimagine the ATS:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the core ATS experience and lead the rethink of how it is structured and how it works to improve customer value and product effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Employer Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the metrics for employer review and response rates on the platform, and build the experiences that move them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Launch the Employer Mobile App:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the development of our employer mobile app, from vision and roadmap through launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run rapid experimentation: &lt;/strong&gt;You will test frequently and ship a steady stream of product improvements, taking advantage of an area where we can move faster than almost anywhere else in the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Obsess over your metrics:&lt;/strong&gt; You will have a deep understanding of the funnels and conversion rates that drive your product area, and you will use data to size opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Voice of the User:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the voice of the SMB customer to the rest of the team, constantly talking to your users, doing product discovery, and conducting user research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion AI-Driven Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Lean into ZipRecruiter&#39;s AI-first DNA to build personalized, proactive experiences that act like a personal recruiter for every job seeker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate Marketplace Fit:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with job-seeker-side product teams to ensure a healthy, balanced marketplace where employer and seeker actions lead to successful hires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
