&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of proven success in product management, with a record of delivering results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deeply Analytical:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a data-obsessed problem solver who doesn&#39;t just look at dashboards but interrogates the &quot;why&quot; behind the numbers. You are comfortable in SQL and fluent in A/B experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifecycle or Notifications Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have owned email, push, or lifecycle messaging products at consumer scale, and you understand the tension between engagement volume and user trust.&lt;/li&gt;
