&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; You write and speak clearly, and collaborate well across engineering, data science, design, and go-to-market stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Motivation:&lt;/strong&gt; You are highly driven and thrive when given the autonomy to drive massive impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
