&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketplace Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous experience at a two-sided marketplace (e.g., jobs, real estate, rideshare), where your work on one side had to account for outcomes on the other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Send-Decisioning or Growth Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building message selection, frequency capping, or channel orchestration systems, or growth/CRM automation at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliverability Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Working knowledge of email deliverability, sender reputation, and compliance regimes including SMS/RCS.&lt;/li&gt;
